= render 'shared/site_page', page_title: 'About Baldrick', current_page: 'About Baldrick', page_subtitle: 'The story behind the name and the ecosystem', document_title: 'About Baldrick - Baldrick Board Documentation', meta: ['British engineering', 'Community built', 'Clever by design'] do
  p.lead Baldrick isn't just a name — it's a philosophy. Inspired by the TV character, he's loyal, hardworking, the perfect sidekick, and of course a true British icon. That's the spirit we've baked into every Baldrick board.

  .prose
    .callout.warn
      span.ic
        svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
          circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
          path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
      div
        span.lbl Our mission
        p.bd To create controller boards that are not just functional, but delightfully clever and surprisingly powerful.

    h2
      span.hk
        span.bar
        span.annot Origin
      | The name

    p The name "Baldrick" comes from the cunning character in the classic British comedy Blackadder. Just like our namesake, our boards are designed to be clever, resourceful, and surprisingly effective despite their humble appearance.

    p When you choose a Baldrick board, you're not just getting a controller — you're getting technology that thinks outside the box, finds clever solutions to complex problems, and does it all with a touch of British wit.

    h2
      span.hk
        span.bar
        span.annot Philosophy
      | What makes Baldrick special

    .spec-grid
      .spec
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
            path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4.5L18 21l-6-4-6 4 1.5-7.5L2 9h7z"
        h4 Clever design
        p Every board is designed with intelligence and efficiency in mind.
      .spec
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
            path d="M3 21h18M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14M9 21v-6h6v6"
        h4 British engineering
        p Built with the precision and reliability you'd expect from British craftsmanship.
      .spec
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
            path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"
        h4 Community focus
        p Crafted by people who live and breathe light shows.
      .spec
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
            path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"
        h4 Innovation
        p Constantly pushing the boundaries of what's possible in lighting control.

    h2
      span.hk
        span.bar
        span.annot Ecosystem
      | Our boards

    p From pixel controllers to relay boards, from interactive controllers to power distribution units, every Baldrick board is designed with the same philosophy: make it simple, make it clever, make it work.

    p Whether you're building a small display or a massive installation, there's a Baldrick board that's perfect for your needs. And thanks to our innovative #{link_to 'Turnip Network', breakthroughs_turnip_network_path, class: 'lnk'}, they all work together seamlessly.

    .next-grid
      = link_to boards_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Explore
          span.go →
        h4 View all boards
        p Pixel controllers, relays, inputs and more — find the right fit.
      = link_to where_to_buy_baldrick_boards_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Retailers
          span.go →
        h4 Where to buy
        p Trusted partners worldwide stocking the full Baldrick family.
      = link_to breakthroughs_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Tech
          span.go →
        h4 Baldrick breakthroughs
        p The clever features that make the ecosystem tick.

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Ready to get started?
    p Explore our range of boards and discover how Baldrick can bring your lighting projects to life.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to boards_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Explore boards
        span.ar →
      = link_to where_to_buy_baldrick_boards_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | Where to buy
